**Dmytro Starosud ([@dima-starosud](https://github.com/dima-starosud)) wrote:**

@zzzeek Would following listener be a good workaround?
```
@event.listens_for(Session, 'before_flush')
def delete_custom_object_reference_orphans(session, _, instances):
    for instance in instances:
        if not isinstance(instance, AB):
            continue
        inspection = inspect(instance)
        if instance.a is None or instance.b is None:
            if inspection.persistent:
                session.delete(instance)
            else:
                session.expunge(instance)
```

